{"parse": {"title": "间隔月-07", "pageid": 101220, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%97%B4%E9%9A%94%E6%9C%88-06\" title=\"间隔月-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">间隔月-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%97%B4%E9%9A%94%E6%9C%88-08\" title=\"间隔月-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">间隔月</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.AE.A4.E7.9F.A5.E5.81.8F.E5.B7.AE\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"认知偏差\">认知偏差</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 认知偏差</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Cognitive Bias</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lapulasidatang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lapulasidatang2\"><img alt=\"lapulasidatang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/600px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/900px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/1200px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>虽然遗憾，艾斯黛乐对这次旅行还是很满意。她终于可以尽情和人讨论自己喜欢的话题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅷ：</div><div>自从人类有了文学，蛇的意象就总被和诅咒绑在一块儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅷ：</div><div>从伊甸园的食尘之蛇到吉尔伽美什的史诗，就连梅露西娜的传说也是这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅷ：</div><div>我经常会被人类中心主义视角气得恨不得放弃自己的文学爱好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>你真该跟乌尔里希聊聊，我甜美的小南瓜。他之前好像就在你们那儿度假？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>那可是拉普拉斯著名的反人类中心主义观点持有者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅷ：</div><div>是吗？真遗憾我没来得及认识他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div>因为那阵子二号忙得脚不沾地，当然最重要的是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅴ：</div><div>那阵子你冬眠了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div>不过没什么值得遗憾的，他看起来对文学一窍不通。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅴ：</div><div>但应该能跟他聊聊养鱼，他的鱼缸看起来质量比小黄瓜的好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就在小蛇们聊得正高兴的时候，冷周六逐个拎起了它们，并放回了自己头上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我会记得就鱼缸材料构成跟乌尔里希通信，问问他有什么推荐的材料配比。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>离别的感伤在我心中弥漫，亲爱的西尔维。你又要离开了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>我已经为你准备好了礼物，主要是一些你们那儿少见的方便食品……哦，还有这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>这是我珍藏的，我祖母的菜谱。愿你每天都有好胃口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>这可真不错！你会介意我把它交给餐厅的主厨吗？你知道的，我不经常自己下厨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>随你喜欢，亲爱的。我祖母是一位慷慨又仁慈的老人，她不会介意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>我还为你准备了一首长诗作为临别致辞，我现在就念给你听怎么样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>等一等，这还是太夸张了，而且——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>你果然不喜欢这么冗长的文本分享。没关系，我特地为你准备一个简短的版本。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六张了张嘴，但绿棱镜用演说家一般的手势打断了她，并极为正式地清了清嗓子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>亲爱的西尔维，我在此与你道别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>受限于我的种族，试着用梅露西娜的视角看问题可不容易。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>但作为朋友和——我希望你允许我这么说——导师，我可以给你我所有的尊重和支持。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>愿你的才华和理想能够再度震动拉普拉斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>太好了，这正是我需要的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>过分快活的语调打破了略微伤感离别的氛围，也让绿棱镜酝酿许久的情绪陡然落空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>哦，当然不是说震惊拉普拉斯的部分，这个不重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我们昨晚商量出了个绝妙的点子，你一定会喜欢的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>就算你不喜欢，也请给我你所有的尊重和支持——这可是你刚才亲口说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">绿棱镜：</div><div>西尔维？我……是的，我确实才说过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不知道为什么，绿棱镜忽然很想收回自己的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而冷周六兴致勃勃，她确信自己的好朋友一定能帮上大忙。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>早上喂鱼的时候，库珀花环从指针处获悉，生态缸的主人已经结束了休假，以后可以自行履行喂鱼的义务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但女孩并没有想到，欢迎对方结束休假的道路已经被满地的纸箱阻塞了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>冷周六女士，我听说您回来了……一切都还顺利吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>当然，顺利极了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两条小蛇协力拖着一口纸箱路过，好心女孩连忙帮了它们一把。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>您看起来需要帮忙，请让我来吧。在马戏团的时候，我也经常帮着搬些道具。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>太感谢你了，阿涅娅。搬家可是个大工程，这些实验材料和样本都得好好打包。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>要是能用传送软盘搬家就好了，可惜相关功能都还很不完善。这方面是不是可以开个全新的课题骗……呃，申请经费？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>虽然它现在已经承担和实现了很多一开始不打算让它具备的功能，但你所说的其实是它被赋予的最初使命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>传送软盘项目的资深主持者一进来，就掐灭了冷周六不该燃起的希望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>所以您要去拉普拉斯科算中心总部了吗，冷周六女士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>可以这么说——别碰那个，马克西姆！那需要特殊的封存。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div>别这么大声，吓蛇一跳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>指针静静地看着屋里的热火朝天，很快得出了运算结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>看起来我在这里好像帮不上什么忙？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>那么，我也该回去忙自己的事了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>哦，当然，我能处理好这些的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>库珀花环觉得自己必须做点什么。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lapulasidatang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lapulasidatang2\"><img alt=\"lapulasidatang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/600px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/900px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-lapulasidatang2.png/1200px-Cg-lapulasidatang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-311701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>请等一等，指针女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩小跑着追上了她，手里还抱着未及放下的纸箱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>有什么事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>您不打算做点什么吗？比如，比如挽留一下她？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>冷周六？……为什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我只是以为，你们还会继续合作……在这个项目变成去太空之前，一定还有很多没来得及完成的部分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>确实有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>但绿棱镜的项目也很出色，拉普拉斯可不会随便给出最高评级。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>那您呢？您是怎么打算的呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她总是这样，看到有人没被好好地安排照顾，就会不自觉地试图接手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>我？我要回去收拾东西，继续完善研究方案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在下一个瞬间，指针忽然读懂了女孩的担忧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>不用担心我。在冷周六来之前，我也是一个人在做这个项目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>虽然少了个人可能会有进度问题，但我想她应该会有空回信交流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>是……这样吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>只是这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员轻轻拨了拨头发，机械结构有序地运转着，独立而缜密。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>如果那是她想做的研究，没人能改变她的主意。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "间隔月-07"}}